      "stadium.text.miltank.honest": "The run stopped at an SPRT boundary, so 55.5% is <em>biased high</em> by the stopping rule — the verdict carries the error rate, the point estimate does not. There is no A/A noise floor for this comparison; three split-half cuts (0.2, 3.9, 1.3 points against an effect of 5.5) stand in for one and are labelled a substitute, and all four figures are carried by <code>data/rollout-r4.json</code> itself. And the engine moved after the games were played, so transfer to the current build is an assumption the artifact states rather than tests.",
